The evening card's bookkeeper ask (box 48942, released 15:01:59Z) reached the
helper as „ხომ არ იცნობს კარგ ბუღალტერს." — third person, a full stop. The
editor had rewritten it; the log says „sent as written — the rewrite was not
usable": #2212's check saw „იცნობს" turn into „იცნობ" and threw the fix
away. 2579 had already exempted a draft that OPENS with „იცნობს"; „ხომ არ" in
front hid that opening. Question particles (ხომ, არ, ვერ, თუ, ნეტა, იქნებ)
put nobody before the verb, so they are passed over. A named person after
them still stays third person (test).

